{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kqSY3veFKO1795159324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平夫人彭麗媛同出席APEC會議的領導人夫人團，參觀非遺展覽。</p><p></p><p>彭麗媛同韓國總統夫人金惠景、新加坡總理夫人呂子蕊、泰國總理夫人塔娜儂等來到深圳灣文化廣場，她們先合影，現場有小朋友表演醒獅及英歌舞歡迎嘉賓。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PENG-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yp0IhAvNtV1795159334.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>彭麗媛又邀請來賓參觀「嶺南非遺傳承與創新」主題展，一起觀看非遺工藝品，欣賞嶺南特色小型文藝展示，體驗數字化騎樓街景。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PENG-1500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026irfEAWr9mI1795159352.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>彭麗媛指嶺南文化是中華文化重要支脈，展現了人與自然和合共生智慧，中方願同各方加強文化交流互鑒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:03:54.633943+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:37:15.979622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:15.884945+00:00","content_hash":"657d8019e68b22db35eff14da3e52576d5cacf065cea6cb2f3b895ddce52366f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:03:54.633943+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}